      * MQSTMC2  - TRIGGER MESSAGE 2 (CHAR), STAND-IN FOR THIS ESTATE
           05  MQS-TMC-STRUCID        PIC X(4) VALUE 'TMC '.
           05  MQS-TMC-VERSION        PIC X(4) VALUE '   2'.
           05  MQS-TMC-QNAME          PIC X(48).
           05  MQS-TMC-PROCESS        PIC X(48).
           05  MQS-TMC-TRIGDATA       PIC X(64).
           05  MQS-TMC-APPTYPE        PIC X(4).
           05  MQS-TMC-APPLID         PIC X(256).
           05  MQS-TMC-ENVDATA        PIC X(128).
           05  MQS-TMC-USERDATA       PIC X(128).
           05  MQS-TMC-QMGRNAME       PIC X(48).
